<title>UK: Johnson Matthey Kyocera in chip pact.</title>
<headline>Johnson Matthey Kyocera in chip pact.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>British metals and industrial materials group Johnson Matthey Plc said on Thursday it agreed with Japan's Kyocera Corp to license to each other technology for the packaging of semiconductors and other advanced semiconductors.</p>
</text>
